// Description: Detects potential misuse of NTDSUtil to create full backups of Active Directory database, which may indicate credential dumping from Domain Controllers
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1003.003 (NTDS), T1484.001 (Domain Policy Modification Abuse Context)
// Data Source: DeviceProcessEvents
// Severity: Critical
// False Positives: Legitimate domain controller backups performed by enterprise backup tools or IT administrators

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessCommandLine has_all ("ntdsutil", "create full", "pro")
